From: Senemos Maintainers <75160848+MCC45TR@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] drm/msm: add an opt-in Uke RGB DSC and checked FEC path

Use the upstream RC/PPS helpers with the exact Cliffs OEM transport contract
from Xiaomi display 44275c404a677d9d9e5230fedd1af2ef02fc7b9a. The source is
GPL-2.0-only; retained files preserve their original attribution. The new
helper documents the OEM transport attribution separately.

Keep compression off by default and require a disconnected root-owned policy
change. Admit only RGB 8/10 bpc at 8 compressed bpp, one or two source-bounded
slices, compatible receiver capabilities and successful FEC/DSC responses.
Preserve the downstream HDMI TMDS check, uncompressed path and DSI behavior.
Program only the 88 RGB PPS bytes with hardware registers; their reserved
packet tail must not overwrite the following audio register bank.

This adds source support, not physical acceptance. MST, four-lane Type-C
negotiation, chroma conversion and higher compressed rates are separate work.

